{"id":1824649,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-13T18:49:39.279Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/2sHY8C3jasaBnoPptc31kXAOY2g.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":18,"name":"Drama"}],"homepage":"https://www.freshwave.hk/?a=doc&id=482","id":1824649,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["HK"],"original_language":"cn","original_title":"香土黃色瘋情畫","overview":"Call Mo obsessively neurotic or just sentimental, but he just wants to pursue the perfect colour yellow. He appears to be impervious to emotions except when he encounters yellow objects. Tin, the cousin of a friend, appeared amid Mo's constant failure in his pursuit of perfection. Caring and attentive, Tin wants Mo to try something new: mark down the most impressive thing that happened every single day. Thus started Mo's journey in trying out an oddball assortment of jobs in Hong Kong, yet Tin always appear mysteriously. Will the mystery of Mo's fascination with the colour be unfolded? Will he be untangled from the hues of yellow everywhere?","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/wYD9jD1JhKXRayDzd1Twdsg892h.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":61392,"logo_path":"/e1g54NyBA3ICLice0kKOYHMc84u.png","name":"Fresh Wave","origin_country":"HK"},{"id":61393,"logo_path":"/zBPeWCDSwQ2PDSRHacdt4HPHw3n.png","name":"Hong Kong Arts Development Council","origin_country":"HK"}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"HK","name":"Hong Kong"}],"release_date":"2014-12-07","revenue":0,"runtime":25,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Cantonese","iso_639_1":"cn","name":"广州话 / 廣州話"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Yellow Everything","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":5901096,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Jacky Chan Yik Kei","original_name":"Jacky Chan Yik Kei","popularity":0.1849,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":4,"character":"Mo","credit_id":"6af695cab6238da7d539f288","order":0},{"adult":false,"gend